    "name": "Shards of Her",
    "steam_appid": 2442530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/5abe686c236378c2416541450c747067.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world full of magic and where once the gods reigned supreme, but now hunted and on the brink of oblivion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A vanished love. A forgotten war. A destiny he never knew.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Michael</strong>'s world is turned upside down when a fallen goddess returns, forcing him to confront his own mysterious origins and a looming battle between gods and mortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His search for answers will reveal a truth more dangerous than he could ever imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/441f4a564180c09a3d098ec2e25dd3b8.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, Branching Narrative </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Immerse yourself in a multi-Act story with over 58k words (and growing...), where your choices  shape relationships and the fate of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Explore a world brought to life by high quality renders and detailed character designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Voice Over </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Experience <i><strong>key narrative</strong></i> moments enhanced by compelling voice narration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Codex &amp; Lore Entries </strong>-\u00a0Uncover detailed character biographies, shard descriptions, realm histories, location details, and a comprehensive timeline within the in-game <strong>CODEX</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Themes </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Explores complex topics including grief, desire, sacrifice, and existential threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/aa63d6cfa1533730b8abaa7a133bdaa4.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world of <strong>Shards of Her</strong> through <strong>Michael</strong>'s eyes, confront fragmented memories of your lost divine love while piecing together conflicting truths about the Primordial Dawn from powerful, biased sources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds with complex allies, but beware manipulation by ancient forces. Navigate temptations of the flesh and soul that test your resolve, make sacrifices with unforeseen costs, and wield power you barely comprehend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you how you walk this path of <i>remembrance</i> and <i>reckoning</i>, but remember: every choice resonates, shaping not only your destiny but the fate of reality itself.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;<i>They survived one Dawn, hoping for peace... They should have prayed the dawn never came again.</i>&quot; - Aethra</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/8935567eebd4b836977baa1df9466ff7.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong> -\u00a0Explore the lives and legends of those who shape the destiny of this world.\u00a0Uncover their pasts, their powers, and explore their evolving forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REALMS</strong> -\u00a0Explore the realms touched by both divine grace and primordial darkness. Uncover their forgotten lore, and prepare to walk their paths once more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SHARDS</strong> -\u00a0Delve into the mysteries of the Seven Shards,\u00a0remnants of a shattered goddess. Learn their histories, their powers, and the sins they embody.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTROLOGY</strong> -\u00a0Decipher the language of the stars. Explore the months and signs that guide the fate of this world, and discover the hidden connections between the heavens and the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIMELINE</strong> -\u00a0From the whispers of creation to the clash of destinies, witness the turning points that defined a universe.\u00a0Uncover the truth behind the legends, one event at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/34ed39a386699f1a50bf48e9a92e8212.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ORCHESTRA</strong> -\u00a0Relive the moments. Access and listen to the game's full musical score and memorable tracks here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHADOW REALM</strong> -\u00a0Enter the gallery to view your favorite characters up close! Explore different outfits, dynamic poses,  or alternate appearances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIALS</strong> -\u00a0Fun extras and bonus content! Check back here for special holiday-themed scenes, '<i>what-if</i>' scenarios, or other non-canon side stories added in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;<i>When the <strong>Tempest</strong>'s fragments sing, and the <strong>Reaper</strong> begins its harvest... what hope remains? May the gods of creation have mercy, for their world teeters on oblivion.</i>&quot; - Melitha</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/5abe686c236378c2416541450c747067.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world full of magic and where once the gods reigned supreme, but now hunted and on the brink of oblivion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A vanished love. A forgotten war. A destiny he never knew.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Michael</strong>'s world is turned upside down when a fallen goddess returns, forcing him to confront his own mysterious origins and a looming battle between gods and mortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His search for answers will reveal a truth more dangerous than he could ever imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/441f4a564180c09a3d098ec2e25dd3b8.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, Branching Narrative </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Immerse yourself in a multi-Act story with over 58k words (and growing...), where your choices  shape relationships and the fate of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Explore a world brought to life by high quality renders and detailed character designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Voice Over </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Experience <i><strong>key narrative</strong></i> moments enhanced by compelling voice narration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Codex &amp; Lore Entries </strong>-\u00a0Uncover detailed character biographies, shard descriptions, realm histories, location details, and a comprehensive timeline within the in-game <strong>CODEX</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Themes </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Explores complex topics including grief, desire, sacrifice, and existential threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/aa63d6cfa1533730b8abaa7a133bdaa4.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world of <strong>Shards of Her</strong> through <strong>Michael</strong>'s eyes, confront fragmented memories of your lost divine love while piecing together conflicting truths about the Primordial Dawn from powerful, biased sources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds with complex allies, but beware manipulation by ancient forces. Navigate temptations of the flesh and soul that test your resolve, make sacrifices with unforeseen costs, and wield power you barely comprehend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you how you walk this path of <i>remembrance</i> and <i>reckoning</i>, but remember: every choice resonates, shaping not only your destiny but the fate of reality itself.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;<i>They survived one Dawn, hoping for peace... They should have prayed the dawn never came again.</i>&quot; - Aethra</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/8935567eebd4b836977baa1df9466ff7.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong> -\u00a0Explore the lives and legends of those who shape the destiny of this world.\u00a0Uncover their pasts, their powers, and explore their evolving forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REALMS</strong> -\u00a0Explore the realms touched by both divine grace and primordial darkness. Uncover their forgotten lore, and prepare to walk their paths once more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SHARDS</strong> -\u00a0Delve into the mysteries of the Seven Shards,\u00a0remnants of a shattered goddess. Learn their histories, their powers, and the sins they embody.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTROLOGY</strong> -\u00a0Decipher the language of the stars. Explore the months and signs that guide the fate of this world, and discover the hidden connections between the heavens and the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIMELINE</strong> -\u00a0From the whispers of creation to the clash of destinies, witness the turning points that defined a universe.\u00a0Uncover the truth behind the legends, one event at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442530/extras/34ed39a386699f1a50bf48e9a92e8212.avif?t=1750864388\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ORCHESTRA</strong> -\u00a0Relive the moments. Access and listen to the game's full musical score and memorable tracks here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHADOW REALM</strong> -\u00a0Enter the gallery to view your favorite characters up close! Explore different outfits, dynamic poses,  or alternate appearances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIALS</strong> -\u00a0Fun extras and bonus content! Check back here for special holiday-themed scenes, '<i>what-if</i>' scenarios, or other non-canon side stories added in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;<i>When the <strong>Tempest</strong>'s fragments sing, and the <strong>Reaper</strong> begins its harvest... what hope remains? May the gods of creation have mercy, for their world teeters on oblivion.</i>&quot; - Melitha</h2>",
